"required for security reasons, to ensure that your browser is not being "
"hijacked by third parties."
msgstr ""
"Unaona ujumbe huu kwa sababu tovuti hii ya HTTPS inahitaji 'kichwa cha "
"Referer' kitumwe na kivinjari chako cha wavuti, lakini hakuna kilichotumwa. "
"Kichwa hiki kinahitajika kwa sababu za usalama, ili kuhakikisha kuwa "
"kivinjari chako hakitekwii na wahusika wengine."

#: eventyay/base/views/errors.py:30
msgid ""
"If you have configured your browser to disable 'Referer' headers, please re-"
"enable them, at least for this site, or for HTTPS connections, or for 'same-"
"origin' requests."
msgstr ""
"Ikiwa umeweka kivinjari chako kuzima vichwa vya 'Referer', tafadhali viwashe "
"tena, angalau kwa tovuti hii, au kwa miunganisho ya HTTPS, au kwa maombi ya "
"'same-origin'."

#: eventyay/base/views/errors.py:36
msgid ""
"You are seeing this message because this site requires a CSRF cookie when "
"submitting forms. This cookie is required for security reasons, to ensure "
"that your browser is not being hijacked by third parties."
msgstr ""
"Unaona ujumbe huu kwa sababu tovuti hii inahitaji kidakuzi cha CSRF "
"unapowasilisha fomu. Kidakuzi hiki kinahitajika kwa sababu za usalama, "
"kuhakikisha kuwa kivinjari chako hakijatekwa na wahusika wengine."

#: eventyay/base/views/errors.py:42
msgid ""
"If you have configured your browser to disable cookies, please re-enable "
"them, at least for this site, or for 'same-origin' requests."
msgstr ""
"Ikiwa umeweka kivinjari chako kuzima vidakuzi, tafadhali viwashe tena, "
"angalau kwa tovuti hii, au kwa maombi ya 'same-origin'."

