"will still proceed, but might create a \"split\" room, i.e. two groups of "
"people who think they are in the same room but are not. Recordings of the "
"room will be no longer accessible through the interface later. It is "
"recommended to join the room yourself to be able to react to this. Use with "
"caution."
msgstr ""
"Kuhamisha chumba kutajaribu kuwaondoa wote kwenye chumba. Watu watahitaji "
"kujiunga tena kwa kupakia upya ukurasa. Ikiwa kuwaondoa watu kutashindikana "
"(kwa mfano seva imezima), bado itaendelea, lakini inaweza kuunda chumba "
"\"kilichogawanyika\", yaani makundi mawili ya watu wanaodhani wako kwenye "
"chumba kilekile lakini sivyo. Rekodi za chumba hazitapatikana tena kupitia "
"kiolesura baadaye. Inapendekezwa ujiunge na chumba mwenyewe ili uweze "
"kuitikia hali hii. Tumia kwa tahadhari."

